From 4268afb2936d16937587df9bb8bbfbdbef2b3b43 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Meraki team <iskandarqosimov120@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:34:48 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Localize Meraki for Malaysia and add a "Why Meraki" section

- Default currency MYR, locale en-MY, time zone Asia/Kuala_Lumpur and
  geocoder country "my"; other countries only change env variables
- Demo data and sample accounts moved from New York to Klang Valley
  neighbourhoods with Malaysian names, +60 phones and local addresses
- "ZIP code" wording changed to "postcode"; rate label uses the set currency
- About page: problem / solution / who it helps, Malaysia launch and
  worldwide note, payment methods FAQ (FPX, Touch 'n Go, GrabPay planned)
- Tests use midday Malaysia time so slots never cross midnight

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LNRskiV98Eb26e7Vwx8sD8
